From 9d432a3d51f8055d446675fc05e64ec657dfec41 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sunshineinabox <aqemail@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 21:42:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] tee: qcomtee: reach uefisecapp through the QSEECom compat app
 loader

On chips whose UEFI uses ScmDxeCompat, such as SM8650 and SM8750, UEFI
loads uefisecapp through QTEE's QSEECom compat app loader over SMCInvoke.
QTEE's legacy QSEECOM app lookup doesn't find apps loaded that way, so
qcom_qseecom offers no uefisecapp client, and QTEE 5.2 refuses
uefisecapp.


uefisecapp refuses writes at runtime here, so the variables can be read 
but not written.

Applies on top of "Add TEE based client driver for UEFI Secure
Application" v5, patches 1-5.
